<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">学生工作区</text><text class="title">教学方案活动</text><text class="muted">活动开始、自报完成和困难反馈独立记录。正式诊断、复测由真实测评答卷决定，不用自报完成代替。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view><text wx:if="{{busy}}" class="muted">正在核对版本、活动或原操作…</text>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="notice"><text>有结果待确认的原操作。即使方案已换版，也可先查询；不会自动重发或生成新操作替代。</text><button bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy}}">查询原操作回执</button><button wx:if="{{canRetry}}" bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy}}">明确重试原请求</button><button bindtap="abandon" disabled="{{busy}}">关闭本机追踪并核对记录</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{receipt}}" class="card"><text class="heading">原操作已确认：{{receipt.label}}</text><text>{{receipt.at}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{receipt.text}}</text><text class="muted">这是原活动的历史事实，不会将旧操作套用到新方案。</text></view>
  <block wx:if="{{plan}}">
    <view class="card"><text class="heading">{{plan.subject}}教学方案 · 第 {{plan.version}} 版</text><text>{{plan.className}} · {{plan.teacher}}</text><text>{{plan.status}} · {{plan.executionLabel}}</text><text wx:if="{{plan.executionState !== 0}}" class="notice">当前停止新执行；原有记录保留，已经开始的正式测评仍按其原规则处理。结束安排不表示已经掌握。</text>
      <block wx:if="{{content}}"><text class="heading">{{content.title}}</text><text class="prewrap">目标：{{content.goal}}</text><text class="prewrap">教师安排：{{content.teacherActions}}</text><text class="prewrap">核对标准：{{content.success}}</text><text>计划 {{content.starts}} 至 {{content.ends}}</text><text>复测安排 {{content.reassessment}}</text><text wx:for="{{content.targets}}" wx:key="code">{{item.code}} · {{item.name}} · 修订 {{item.version}}</text></block>
      <text class="notice" wx:else>当前方案正文未开放。已提供活动的本人上交记录按当前身份保留，不能借历史读取失效材料。</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{choices.length > 0}}" class="card"><text class="heading">选择活动</text><picker range="{{choices}}" range-key="title" value="{{selectedIndex}}" bindchange="select" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="field">{{choices[selectedIndex].title}}</view></picker></view>
    <block wx:if="{{activity}}">
      <view class="card"><text class="heading">{{activity.title}}</text><text>{{activity.kindLabel}} · {{activity.stateLabel}}</text><text wx:if="{{activity.instructions}}" class="prewrap">{{activity.instructions}}</text><text wx:if="{{activity.due}}" class="muted">计划完成 {{activity.due}} · 预计 {{activity.minutes}} 分钟；正式测评另按其真实时限执行。</text>
        <text wx:if="{{!activity.materialsAvailable}}" class="notice">指定材料当前不可用，不能新开始或自报完成；已提供活动可反馈材料困难。</text>
        <button wx:for="{{activity.materials}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="material" disabled="{{busy || !canWrite || !activity.materialsAvailable || !activity.canReadMaterials}}">阅读 {{item.title}}</button>
        <block wx:if="{{activity.isFormal}}"><text wx:if="{{!activity.assessment}}" class="notice">此诊断或复测等待老师关联正式测评，不能自报完成。</text>
          <block wx:else><text wx:if="{{activity.assessment.requiresPermission}}" class="notice">关联测评需要当前测评参与权限，请联系学校核对。</text><text wx:if="{{activity.assessment.stopped}}" class="notice">已停止新的关联执行；已经开始的原答卷仍按其测评规则处理。</text><text wx:if="{{activity.assessment.sealed !== '—'}}">正式答卷已封存：{{activity.assessment.sealed}}</text><button wx:if="{{activity.assessment.canOpen}}" bindtap="assessment" disabled="{{busy}}">查看关联测评 / 原答卷</button></block>
        </block>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{material}}" class="card"><text class="heading">{{material.title}}</text><text wx:if="{{!material.available}}">材料当前不可读取。</text><text class="prewrap">{{material.text}}</text>
        <view wx:if="{{material.pages > 1}}" class="pager"><button data-direction="-1" bindtap="materialPage" disabled="{{busy || material.page === 1}}">上一段</button><text>{{material.page}} / {{material.pages}}</text><button data-direction="1" bindtap="materialPage" disabled="{{busy || material.page >= material.pages}}">下一段</button></view>
        <block wx:for="{{material.attachments}}" wx:key="id"><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="attachment" disabled="{{busy || !canWrite || !item.type}}">预览 {{item.name}}</button><text wx:if="{{!item.type}}" class="muted">此类型或大小请在网页阅读。原生支持 20 MB 内的常用文档和图片。</text></block>
        <text class="footnote">预览产生设备临时副本，离开时尝试清理；资料撤回会停止后续在线读取，不能收回已看到或另存的副本。</text>
      </view>
      <view wx:if="{{form &amp;&amp; canWrite}}" class="card"><text class="heading">记录本次学习</text><text class="muted">未上交输入只在本次页面内存，离开会丢失。用时只随自报完成上交；阅读、开始与完成都不表示已掌握。</text>
        <view wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="notice">云端学生记录已变化。原输入和基准保留，请核对历史后明确丢弃并重读，不会自动覆盖。</view>
        <textarea class="feedback-text short-text" value="{{form.text}}" data-field="text" bindinput="change" maxlength="2000" placeholder="学习总结、困难，或完成后重新开始的原因" aria-label="拟上交给本方案教师的文字" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" />
        <checkbox-group data-field="share" bindchange="change"><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.share}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" />同意将填写的文字上交给本方案教师</label></checkbox-group>
        <picker range="{{difficulties}}" value="{{form.difficulty}}" data-field="difficulty" bindchange="change" disabled="{{busy || pending}}"><view class="field">困难类型：{{difficulties[form.difficulty]}}</view></picker>
        <input class="field" value="{{form.minutes}}" data-field="minutes" bindinput="change" type="number" placeholder="自报完成用时（可选，1–1440 分钟）" aria-label="自报完成用时" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" />
        <checkbox-group data-field="activityOnly" bindchange="change"><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.activityOnly}}" disabled="{{busy || pending}}" />自报完成仅表示学习活动，不表示已经掌握</label></checkbox-group>
        <button wx:if="{{activity.canStart}}" data-action="0" bindtap="progress" disabled="{{busy || pending || conflict}}">记录开始 / 说明原因后重新开始</button><button wx:if="{{activity.canComplete}}" data-action="1" bindtap="progress" type="primary" disabled="{{busy || pending || conflict}}">核对并上交自报完成</button><button wx:if="{{activity.canReport}}" data-action="2" bindtap="progress" disabled="{{busy || pending || conflict}}">核对并上交困难反馈</button>
        <button bindtap="discard" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">丢弃本机输入并重读这个版本</button>
      </view>
      <view class="card"><text class="heading">我的已上交记录</text><text wx:if="{{activity.handled !== '—'}}">老师处理当前困难的时间：{{activity.handled}}</text><view wx:for="{{history}}" wx:key="id" class="class-row"><text>{{item.revision}} · {{item.label}} · {{item.at}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.difficulty}}">{{item.difficulty}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{item.text}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.minutes}}">自报 {{item.minutes}} 分钟</text></view><text wx:if="{{historyTotal === 0}}" class="muted">尚无已上交记录。</text><view class="pager"><button data-direction="-1" bindtap="paginate" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页</button><text>{{historyTotal}} 条</text><button data-direction="1" bindtap="paginate" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= historyTotal}}">下一页</button></view></view>
    </block>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="image-panel"><image class="image-area" mode="aspectFit" src="{{imagePath}}" show-menu-by-longpress="{{false}}" /><button bindtap="closeImage">关闭图片</button></view>
  <button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新这个版本与记录</button><button bindtap="list">回到方案列表选择当前版本</button><button bindtap="web">复制这个版本的网页地址</button><button wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="login">返回登录</button>
</view>
